---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="flex min-h-screen flex-col items-center justify-center bg-zinc-50 p-8">
    <div class="w-full max-w-xl rounded-lg border bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Reporting Web</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600">
        Project scaffold ready. Connected to Google Sheets logic will live here. Database layer uses
        Convex. No business logic or tables created yet.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-6 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-zinc-600">
        <li>Astro + React + Tailwind + shadcn</li>
        <li>TypeScript strict</li>
        <li>ESLint + Prettier</li>
        <li>Vitest + Testing Library + Playwright</li>
        <li>Convex initialized (empty schema)</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-zinc-400">
        Next phase will define users, configs, and Sheets integration.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
